# wheel-burst-k (M7): three wheel notches up on k's box (centre (383, 468) at 1440 x 900) in one
# frame, a burst: each notch is 15 px of drag (scrub.ts wheelDxPx: 100 px of deltaY), 0.3 for a
# shift, and each starts where the last left the value, so k reads 0.90 (Chromium hands
# Playwright's wheel over at half its delta under a device scale of 2, so 0.45 there, on the
# reference too). The page doesn't scroll, and no drag shows.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 383 468
wait 16
wheel 0 -100
wheel 0 -100
wheel 0 -100
wait 1000
shot burst
